<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1855995769"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1573696882"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Voices of the Chord"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="澤野弘之 / R!N/Gemie"/><amll:meta key="album" value="86―エイティシックス― オリジナル・サウンドトラック"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:54.290"><div begin="00:13.630" end="02:54.290"><p begin="00:13.630" end="00:20.410" itunes:key="L1">Hunger for the sleep I know will never come<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道对酣然入睡的渴望永远不会袭来</span></p><p begin="00:20.410" end="00:27.170" itunes:key="L2">Crowded is the space but don't have anyone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">空间拥挤不堪 但是我身边空无一人</span></p><p begin="00:27.170" end="00:33.490" itunes:key="L3">I could read the Bible to drown out the hum<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以朗读圣经 掩盖嗡嗡作响的声音</span></p><p begin="00:33.490" end="00:40.790" itunes:key="L4">Avoid the voices of the Chord<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">避开此起彼伏的声音</span></p><p begin="00:40.790" end="00:47.390" itunes:key="L5">All the roads inside my head loop back to you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我脑海中所有的道路指向你身边</span></p><p begin="00:47.390" end="00:53.720" itunes:key="L6">I've done many things I'd thought I'd never do<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已经做过很多我以为我永远不会做的事</span></p><p begin="00:53.720" end="00:59.130" itunes:key="L7">It's you that I can feel<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能够感觉到的人是你</span></p><p begin="00:59.130" end="01:02.380" itunes:key="L8">But I keep my hands<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我一直用手握着方向盘</span></p><p begin="01:02.380" end="01:06.150" itunes:key="L9">Upon the wheel</p><p begin="01:06.150" end="01:12.550" itunes:key="L10">I turn the page to drown you out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我翻开新的篇章 只为将你淹没</span></p><p begin="01:12.550" end="01:19.300" itunes:key="L11">You are the only thing that I still care about<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我唯一还在乎的人</span></p><p begin="01:19.300" end="01:26.290" itunes:key="L12">If I can heal the conflict that's within<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我能够抚平内心的挣扎纠结</span></p><p begin="01:26.290" end="01:32.770" itunes:key="L13">I'll know the war has reached the bitter end<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会知道战争已经抵达痛苦的终点</span></p><p begin="01:35.720" end="01:42.080" itunes:key="L14">Ocean, you're calling me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一望无垠的海洋 你呼唤着我</span></p><p begin="01:42.080" end="01:47.450" itunes:key="L15">A place with no memory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个没有记忆的世界</span></p><p begin="01:47.450" end="01:48.520" itunes:key="L16">You'll see!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会看见</span></p><p begin="01:48.520" end="01:50.310" itunes:key="L17">I burned the Blood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我热血沸腾</span></p><p begin="01:50.310" end="01:51.920" itunes:key="L18">I passed the test<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我通过考验</span></p><p begin="01:51.920" end="01:55.490" itunes:key="L19">And now my love is laid to rest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 我的爱得到安息</span></p><p begin="01:55.490" end="02:00.070" itunes:key="L20">Our names aren't written on the list<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的名字不会列入名单之中</span></p><p begin="02:00.070" end="02:06.650" itunes:key="L21">I turn the page to drown you out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我翻开新的篇章 只为将你淹没</span></p><p begin="02:06.650" end="02:13.450" itunes:key="L22">You are the only thing that I still care about<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是我唯一还在乎的人</span></p><p begin="02:13.450" end="02:20.310" itunes:key="L23">If I can heal the conflict that's within<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果我能够抚平内心的挣扎纠结</span></p><p begin="02:20.310" end="02:29.550" itunes:key="L24">I'll know the war has reached the bitter end<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会知道战争已经抵达痛苦的终点</span></p><p begin="02:29.550" end="02:36.310" itunes:key="L25">Ocean, you're calling me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一望无垠的海洋 你呼唤着我</span></p><p begin="02:36.310" end="02:41.580" itunes:key="L26">A place with no memory<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一个没有记忆的世界</span></p><p begin="02:41.580" end="02:42.860" itunes:key="L27">You'll see!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你会看见</span></p><p begin="02:42.860" end="02:44.380" itunes:key="L28">I burned the blood<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我热血沸腾</span></p><p begin="02:44.380" end="02:45.940" itunes:key="L29">I passed the test<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我通过考验</span></p><p begin="02:45.940" end="02:49.380" itunes:key="L30">And now my love is laid to rest<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在 我的爱得到安息</span></p><p begin="02:49.380" end="02:52.720" itunes:key="L31">Our names aren't written on the list<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的名字不会列入名单之中</span></p><p begin="02:52.720" end="02:54.290" itunes:key="L32">But you and I know we exist<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是你我都知道我们的存在</span></p></div></body></tt>